{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は幕張メッセにて個別握手会がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった皆様本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のこともあり、いろいろな感情が入り交じっておりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも皆様とお話していくうちに、心が安らかになりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして自分の悪いことも知れたし、こうすればいいのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と気づいた所が沢山ありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分で自分を変えなくちゃならないんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰かの言葉などかキッカケになるときの方が私の場合は多いけど、最後は自分が変えないと変わらないんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかってるようで、わかってなかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うきゃきゃ〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は凄く楽しかったな！リラックスできたし！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からまた頑張るね!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分らしく頑張る!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"難しいけどね〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のお洋服どん!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/9717186/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はこういうお洋服が大好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はｍｏｎｏｍａｎｉａのＴシャツとピースナウのカボチャパンツを着たよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"靴下もかわいいでしょ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/9717186/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから沢山着ると思われます!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日これなかった皆様！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次会うときまで少し我慢ね!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うちも我慢するからね!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/9717186/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまたね!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/02/9717186/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ"}],"source":"archive"}